WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.320
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.320 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:30.520 --> 01:31.300
Wow!

01:31.300 --> 01:32.100
What class you in?

01:32.100 --> 01:33.350
I'm in class C.

01:33.890 --> 01:36.490
Second Year

01:33.890 --> 01:36.490
Class A

01:33.890 --> 01:36.490
Class B

01:33.890 --> 01:36.490
Class C

01:36.890 --> 01:39.540
Ha! We're in the same class again!

01:39.540 --> 01:40.770
Yay!

01:39.540 --> 01:40.770
Whoa.

01:41.970 --> 01:43.740
This is great, Amane!

01:44.180 --> 01:46.730
I don't know what's so great about it.

01:46.730 --> 01:49.000
But I'm glad you're here at least.

01:49.000 --> 01:51.380
What's this? 
Getting sentimental all of a sudden?

01:51.910 --> 01:57.060
Yeah, I totally overslept. 
My mom had to come wake me up.

01:52.500 --> 01:55.670
You must be happy to be 
with Chitose again, though.

01:56.220 --> 01:58.540
Why not just enjoy it, man?

01:57.060 --> 01:59.930
Hey, hey, since today's gonna end early,

01:58.540 --> 02:01.260
You got into the same class 
as the girl you like.

01:59.930 --> 02:02.500
wanna get crepes on the way home, Mahirun?

02:02.500 --> 02:05.270
I guess so. If it's all right with you.

02:05.270 --> 02:07.020
Yeah! Let's go, let's go!

02:07.020 --> 02:08.390
It'll be fun!

02:08.390 --> 02:10.580
I bet you'll go for 
the strawberry one, Mahirun.

02:10.580 --> 02:11.430
Oh.

02:13.270 --> 02:18.280
The Angel in the New Term

02:19.540 --> 02:20.540
Morning!

02:20.540 --> 02:21.940
Hey, Yuta.

02:21.940 --> 02:23.910
I guess we're in the same class again.

02:23.910 --> 02:26.500
Yeah. Good to see you, Fujimiya.

02:28.040 --> 02:30.750
Yeah... you too.

02:31.380 --> 02:34.060
Fujimiya, good to see you again.

02:34.060 --> 02:36.050
Yeah, you too.

02:37.460 --> 02:39.260
Huh? What are you talking about?

02:40.030 --> 02:41.800
You were always...

02:45.170 --> 02:46.020
Fujimiya?

02:46.020 --> 02:49.640
Huh? Oh, sorry. I spaced out.

02:50.860 --> 02:52.650
Good to see you again.

02:54.140 --> 02:57.240
Amane-kun, you don't look well.

02:58.860 --> 03:00.610
Are you under the weather?

03:00.610 --> 03:03.410
Uh, no, that isn't it.

03:03.900 --> 03:06.320
It's just... something else.

03:06.970 --> 03:08.200
Don't worry about it.

03:10.140 --> 03:12.330
Huh? What is it?

03:12.750 --> 03:17.300
Oh, nothing. Your hair looks like 
it would feel really nice to touch.

03:17.300 --> 03:18.260
Huh?!

03:18.580 --> 03:20.340
May I touch it?

03:20.340 --> 03:21.880
Where'd this come from?

03:22.390 --> 03:25.140
I mean, yeah, if you really want to.

03:26.100 --> 03:29.800
Are you sure? Then come right here.

03:29.800 --> 03:30.640
Huh?!

03:31.050 --> 03:34.610
Put your head on my lap 
so I can stroke your hair more easily.

03:35.020 --> 03:36.110
Yeah, no way!

03:36.710 --> 03:39.070
Is my lap not appealing to you?

03:39.070 --> 03:40.740
Uh...

03:49.580 --> 03:53.170
What would you do if I tried 
something indecent right now?

03:54.850 --> 03:58.220
Suddenly leap out of my seat 
and stomp them where they lay?

03:58.220 --> 03:59.940
Pardon my indiscretion!

03:59.940 --> 04:02.820
Well, I don't think you'd try it, Amane-kun.

04:02.820 --> 04:05.840
I doubt you have the guts 
or the energy for something like that.

04:07.220 --> 04:11.180
And since you are tired, 
why not let me do what I want?

04:11.560 --> 04:15.440
It's easier to touch you 
if you stay still anyway.

04:18.590 --> 04:20.940
<i>She's probably worried about me.</i>

04:34.850 --> 04:40.680
So, do you think it's all right to lie on 
a girl's lap without offering a single word?

04:40.680 --> 04:42.880
Is that proper behavior for a gentleman?

04:45.970 --> 04:47.430
Oh, come on.

04:47.430 --> 04:52.070
Chitose-san said she heard that if you let 
a man lie in your lap when he's tired,

04:52.070 --> 04:56.050
it will nourish romantic feelings 
that help relieve his fatigue.

04:58.140 --> 05:00.360
Yes, I think this is quite nice.

05:00.360 --> 05:01.780
Just don't make it a habit.

05:02.540 --> 05:05.480
You can't call it a habit 
when it's only the first time.

05:06.620 --> 05:09.930
But don't mind me. 
I'm going to stroke your hair,

05:09.930 --> 05:13.660
so why don't you relax 
and enjoy it, Amane-kun?

05:15.360 --> 05:16.890
Oh, yeah?

05:16.890 --> 05:18.280
Oh, yes.

05:25.740 --> 05:29.140
How do you feel about 
this year's class, Amane-kun?

05:31.250 --> 05:34.060
I never thought we'd end up 
in the same class.

05:36.000 --> 05:39.230
It was funny to see you looking so surprised.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.690
Yeah, of course I was surprised.

05:42.030 --> 05:44.020
We're gonna have to keep our guard up.

05:44.020 --> 05:45.320
Guard?

05:45.320 --> 05:47.320
We'll have to keep some distance,

05:47.320 --> 05:51.400
so we don't start making small talk 
or acting like we're buddies.

05:54.370 --> 05:56.040
Hee, whar yoo doing?

05:56.040 --> 05:57.760
What? Nothing at all.

05:58.660 --> 06:00.950
What you said makes perfect sense.

06:00.950 --> 06:03.750
I simply don't like that you said it 
without a hint of emotion.

06:04.500 --> 06:06.010
What's that supposed to mean?

06:06.540 --> 06:09.260
Well, I suppose I'll let you 
off the hook for now.

06:09.720 --> 06:13.680
I don't like the "for now" part, 
but yeah, please do.

06:14.370 --> 06:16.790
Will you still act normally when we're home?

06:16.790 --> 06:18.060
Yeah, of course.

06:18.060 --> 06:21.520
Putting my head on your lap 
isn't exactly normal, though.

06:21.860 --> 06:23.690
This doesn't count.

06:24.900 --> 06:26.080
<i>Ugh.</i>

06:27.020 --> 06:29.200
<i>Just spoiling me rotten.</i>

06:29.730 --> 06:31.370
You seem tired.

06:31.820 --> 06:35.820
It's okay. I'll wake you up later.

06:35.820 --> 06:37.000
Sleep to your heart's content.

06:46.380 --> 06:47.380
How long was I out?

06:49.060 --> 06:52.760
About an hour. 
You look very cute when sleeping.

06:54.240 --> 06:55.910
Don't stare at me like that!

06:56.950 --> 06:59.430
How can you say that, Amane-kun?

06:59.430 --> 07:02.310
You see me with my guard down all the time,

07:02.310 --> 07:04.480
so I should get to see you
 all soft and cozy, too.

07:04.890 --> 07:07.740
But you got all soft and cozy by yourse—

07:08.490 --> 07:09.860
Ou ou ouu!

07:10.250 --> 07:13.190
Is this the mouth I heard 
talking nonsense just now?

07:13.190 --> 07:14.660
Ahn shorry.

07:14.660 --> 07:17.330
Very well. Oh, boy.

07:18.880 --> 07:21.570
Your cheeks do have more color now, though.

07:23.650 --> 07:27.100
If you're ever having a tough time, 
you know you can lean on me, right?

07:27.100 --> 07:29.300
Just like I did with you.

07:30.300 --> 07:31.260
I'll do my best.

07:33.490 --> 07:34.890
Fine! I get it!

07:35.430 --> 07:36.390
Very well, then.

07:36.390 --> 07:37.770
You're so pushy.

07:37.770 --> 07:40.140
Girls are supposed to be a little pushy.

07:40.140 --> 07:45.220
Also, nobody else gets to see me 
acting like this, Amane-kun.

07:45.220 --> 07:46.900
I won't do it outside, so no problem.

07:48.290 --> 07:50.740
It's a huge problem! Geez.

07:51.940 --> 07:53.320
You dummy.

07:54.490 --> 07:57.240
<b>Print Club</b>

08:05.750 --> 08:07.900
Welcome home, Amane-kun!

08:08.780 --> 08:10.050
What's in the bag?

08:10.580 --> 08:13.960
I went to the arcade. 
I guess these are trophies.

08:13.960 --> 08:18.380
You sure won a lot. What did you get?

08:18.380 --> 08:19.700
Later, okay?

08:19.700 --> 08:20.970
I'm so hungry.

08:22.510 --> 08:25.440
Why don't you wash your hands and change?

08:25.880 --> 08:28.070
I'll go ahead and set the table.

08:28.520 --> 08:29.780
Roger.

08:40.570 --> 08:42.630
You don't like the bunny?

08:45.340 --> 08:46.250
It's cute.

08:46.730 --> 08:47.710
I'm glad.

09:00.890 --> 09:03.380
Please stop grinning like that.

09:03.380 --> 09:04.520
I'm not!

09:04.520 --> 09:08.900
Yes, you are! You're laughing. 
Like you think I'm a little kid.

09:09.350 --> 09:13.280
That isn't why I'm smiling. 
I just thought you looked cute.

09:14.240 --> 09:16.200
See? You are laughing!

09:16.200 --> 09:17.540
There, now.

09:20.780 --> 09:23.060
I have a strange feeling 
I'm being distracted.

09:23.060 --> 09:24.440
You must be imagining things.

09:24.870 --> 09:27.500
I suppose I can let you distract me for now.

09:30.260 --> 09:33.260
I still feel like you're 
always giving me things.

09:33.980 --> 09:38.420
Your presents, your reassurance, 
your warmth, everything.

09:38.420 --> 09:41.140
It's not a big deal. I just feel like it.

09:41.140 --> 09:43.630
Don't worry about it.

09:43.630 --> 09:46.090
I want to repay you somehow.

09:46.090 --> 09:47.520
You're so stubborn!

09:48.260 --> 09:52.770
But I guess if you're that worried about it, 
I could ask for one thing.

09:53.540 --> 09:55.690
I'm willing to give you anything I can.

09:56.500 --> 09:58.180
<i>Did she say </i>anything<i>?!</i>

10:01.750 --> 10:06.200
Then how about making me pudding? 
Pudding with lots of eggs.

10:06.200 --> 10:08.960
Are you sure you aren't 
taking the easy way out?

10:09.430 --> 10:11.170
Why would I do that?

10:11.170 --> 10:13.300
I'm sure your pudding is more than worth it.

10:14.640 --> 10:16.050
Fine, I'll make some tomorrow.

10:16.930 --> 10:19.370
Firm, with lots of eggs, right?

10:18.260 --> 10:20.500
<b>Select Fresh Eggs</b>

10:18.260 --> 10:20.500
<b>Fresh Eggs</b>

10:19.370 --> 10:21.200
I'll make you a delicious pudding.

10:27.680 --> 10:29.140
This is so good!

10:29.670 --> 10:32.150
I am honored by your kind words.

10:33.380 --> 10:36.230
You really can cook anything.

10:36.230 --> 10:39.450
I was taught to be able to cook most things.

10:39.820 --> 10:43.910
I guess I'm not surprised, 
but it still makes me happy.

10:44.570 --> 10:46.660
It makes you happy?

10:47.100 --> 10:51.720
Well, yeah. You feed me 
delicious meals every day.

10:51.720 --> 10:53.670
There's no way I'd be unhappy.

10:54.430 --> 10:56.050
It's the highlight of my day.

10:57.550 --> 11:00.010
I-Is it really?

11:00.010 --> 11:03.050
I'm flattered by the compliment, Amane-kun.

11:03.840 --> 11:06.570
If it's okay with you, 
I can compliment you all day long.

11:06.570 --> 11:09.100
"Delicious" probably 
gets boring after a while.

11:09.100 --> 11:12.810
If you want more feedback than that, 
I'm happy to give it.

11:12.810 --> 11:16.230
No, that's enough! I'd die!

11:16.230 --> 11:17.830
Quit exaggerating.

11:17.830 --> 11:21.590
I'm not exaggerating. This is plenty.

11:21.590 --> 11:22.450
Really?

11:23.310 --> 11:26.170
But if you're going to keep 
cooking for me every day,

11:26.170 --> 11:28.450
I want to show my sincere gratitude.

11:29.360 --> 11:30.580
Thank you for everything.

11:33.080 --> 11:33.930
Mahiru?

11:35.090 --> 11:36.620
Amane-kun, you dummy!

11:36.620 --> 11:37.180
Huh?

11:44.540 --> 11:48.390
I'll wash them. Go relax on the sofa, okay?

11:59.990 --> 12:04.950
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

12:06.170 --> 12:07.830
Itsuki! Fujimiya!

12:08.890 --> 12:11.910
Getting lunch? Let's eat together.

12:11.910 --> 12:13.850
Sure, I don't mind.

12:14.420 --> 12:15.700
Cool with you, Itsuki?

12:15.700 --> 12:18.700
What makes you think I won't say no?

12:18.700 --> 12:20.510
But yeah, I won't say no.

12:20.910 --> 12:22.100
All set, then.

12:22.100 --> 12:24.210
Yeah, but hold on.

12:24.210 --> 12:26.970
Dude, why is Yuta being so friendly to you?

12:27.720 --> 12:32.480
Fujimiya just seems like a really good guy, 
so I wanted to become friends.

12:32.930 --> 12:37.010
How delightful to meet 
a fellow Amane appreciator.

12:37.010 --> 12:38.240
Come hither, son.

12:38.240 --> 12:39.980
Cool it, big guy.

12:41.910 --> 12:43.700
Kadowaki, can I ask you something?

12:44.650 --> 12:46.980
You sure you want to be friends?

12:46.980 --> 12:50.040
It's not like there's anything in it for you.

12:52.070 --> 12:55.360
Fujimiya, you don't make 
friends for profit, do you?

12:55.360 --> 12:56.740
No, of course not.

12:56.740 --> 12:58.920
Then we're cool.

12:58.920 --> 13:02.050
I just want to get to know you better.

13:02.050 --> 13:02.960
Oh.

13:02.960 --> 13:06.180
Mm-hmm. Having good friends is a good thing!

13:17.490 --> 13:19.130
Are you mad about something?

13:20.440 --> 13:23.120
Oh, no, was I pouting?

13:23.120 --> 13:26.460
You just seemed kind of upset.

13:26.460 --> 13:28.820
If I did something wrong, I apologize.

13:29.300 --> 13:33.470
N-No, it isn't your fault, Amane-kun.

13:33.470 --> 13:36.670
I think I'm just a little narrow-minded.

13:37.140 --> 13:39.380
If <i>you're</i> narrow-minded, Mahiru,

13:39.380 --> 13:42.860
then most peoples' minds could be 
measured in millimeters.

13:43.390 --> 13:45.710
I must have done something wrong.

13:45.710 --> 13:49.100
It really isn't your fault, Amane-kun.

13:49.100 --> 13:52.310
But it does have to do with you.

13:52.310 --> 13:55.550
I still don't understand, 
but if I caused someth—

13:55.550 --> 13:57.790
If you don't understand, 
you shouldn't apologize!

13:58.490 --> 14:01.070
I should be apologizing instead.

14:01.070 --> 14:02.520
That makes even less sense.

14:02.910 --> 14:04.480
Because I'm so narrow-minded.

14:04.820 --> 14:08.590
Fine, fine. Let's say you're narrow-minded.

14:08.590 --> 14:10.830
But what are you so mad about?

14:12.030 --> 14:14.500
Well... I think it's unfair.

14:14.500 --> 14:15.580
Unfair?

14:15.580 --> 14:17.020
With Kadowaki-san.

14:17.020 --> 14:18.300
Kadowaki?

14:18.810 --> 14:22.380
He's a boy, so he can walk right up to you 
and start talking. It isn't fair.

14:22.380 --> 14:25.300
And here I am, holding myself back.

14:25.300 --> 14:26.830
Holding back?

14:26.830 --> 14:31.890
Akazawa-san, Chitose-san, 
and Kadowaki-san can be so casual with you,

14:31.890 --> 14:34.640
but I feel lonely and left out.

14:35.750 --> 14:39.250
Yeah, but still, it would be 
weird if the angel

14:39.250 --> 14:42.080
suddenly started hanging out 
with a boring loner like me.

14:42.810 --> 14:45.690
Why do you always 
put yourself down like that?

14:45.690 --> 14:47.100
It's infuriating.

14:47.940 --> 14:51.260
I overheard you three talking today.

14:51.260 --> 14:54.330
You need to stop being 
so hard on yourself, Amane-kun.

14:54.820 --> 14:59.560
It almost sounds like you're 
mocking the people who like you.

15:00.130 --> 15:01.150
Sorry.

15:01.150 --> 15:04.000
I don't need your sincere apology.

15:04.460 --> 15:07.380
I just want you to have more self-confidence.

15:07.890 --> 15:11.640
Maybe I should go around 
telling people how great you are.

15:12.980 --> 15:16.720
If you do, I'd die 
from embarrassment. Please don't.

15:16.720 --> 15:20.060
What if I make it sound completely natural?

15:20.060 --> 15:23.950
But then we'd definitely be 
spending time together at school!

15:23.950 --> 15:27.620
But I don't want to be the only one left out.

15:27.620 --> 15:30.700
If possible, I want to hang out 
with you like everyone else.

15:31.280 --> 15:33.620
I wouldn't mind that,

15:33.620 --> 15:36.330
but people will notice
 if we act close all of a sudden.

15:36.710 --> 15:38.200
Then we'll take it one step at a time!

15:38.640 --> 15:40.720
Just don't go around spreading 
weird compliments about me.

15:40.720 --> 15:44.860
In that case, for now, 
I'll only compliment you in private.

15:46.850 --> 15:50.670
All right, choose your own groups 
and start planning your menus.

15:52.640 --> 15:54.390
Let's work together, okay?

15:55.230 --> 15:56.390
S-Sure, let's.

15:56.820 --> 15:58.890
Why does Fujimiya get her?!

16:00.940 --> 16:03.650
Amane-kun looks like 
he just swallowed a cockroach.

16:04.000 --> 16:05.900
And whose fault is that?

16:06.430 --> 16:08.530
Mahirun, let's be in the same group!

16:08.530 --> 16:11.990
Oh, let's get Ikkun, 
and how about Amane, too?

16:12.540 --> 16:14.910
I'm sorry to cause so much trouble.

16:15.180 --> 16:17.520
No, it isn't your fault, Shiina.

16:17.520 --> 16:20.410
Well, I guess you gotta surrender to fate.

16:20.410 --> 16:24.290
You shall rue the day you ever 
became friends with me and Chi.

16:25.170 --> 16:28.250
I don't regret being your friend for a second.

16:28.250 --> 16:31.340
Dear me! My heartstrings just went "zing!"

16:32.740 --> 16:35.940
Your heartstrings sound like 
fingernails on a chalkboard.

16:35.940 --> 16:37.100
I think I do regret it now.

16:37.100 --> 16:38.640
You two-faced brute!

16:39.070 --> 16:41.300
Oh, but how I love it 
when you talk dirty to me!

16:41.300 --> 16:42.280
Dude, you're gross.

16:41.810 --> 16:45.560
I always say this, 
but I love how close you are.

16:45.560 --> 16:46.770
I'm very envious.

16:47.580 --> 16:48.230
Well...

16:48.820 --> 16:50.480
Then you want in, Mahirun?

16:50.480 --> 16:51.110
U-Uh?

16:51.570 --> 16:55.140
Hey, cut it out. Don't make her one of you.

16:55.140 --> 16:56.740
Shiina would hate that.

16:56.740 --> 16:59.760
No, I don't think that at all.

16:59.760 --> 17:00.700
Hear that?

17:00.700 --> 17:02.330
Chitose, check yourself.

17:03.020 --> 17:06.290
But whatever. Let's start planning the menu.

17:06.620 --> 17:09.170
Are you trying to take command 
when you can't even cook, Amane?

17:09.570 --> 17:11.960
How dare you! I can make an omelette.

17:11.960 --> 17:15.800
He calls it an omelette, 
but it's basically scrambled eggs.

17:19.960 --> 17:22.560
Are you good at cooking, Akazawa-san?

17:22.560 --> 17:25.690
Me? Good enough to not starve, I guess.

17:26.130 --> 17:29.820
Ikkun's actually pretty good 
at household stuff.

17:29.820 --> 17:31.310
Is that right?

17:33.130 --> 17:35.570
You guys are gonna start 
making me look like a loser.

17:35.570 --> 17:37.120
Too late for that, man.

17:35.570 --> 17:37.120
Oh, it's too late for that.

17:38.070 --> 17:40.200
You don't have to say it together!

17:41.780 --> 17:44.450
But you seem to be doing all right now.

17:45.350 --> 17:48.180
Uh... yeah, I'm working on it.

17:48.180 --> 17:50.000
I do cook when I'm alone sometimes.

17:50.500 --> 17:51.460
Good for you.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.970
Cooking Classroom

17:55.720 --> 17:57.970
You have to put the sugar in first.

18:07.900 --> 18:09.440
I thought you couldn't cook.

18:09.820 --> 18:12.540
I keep telling you that I can.

18:12.540 --> 18:14.750
I'm just being held to an
 unreasonable standard.

18:14.750 --> 18:19.760
Anyway, I learned enough about 
how it works to keep up.

18:19.760 --> 18:21.240
How conscientious!

18:22.260 --> 18:24.700
Shiina, a little more?

18:24.700 --> 18:26.750
Hmm. I think so.

18:27.180 --> 18:29.500
Let it boil down just a little more.

18:29.500 --> 18:31.240
Okay. Got it.

18:35.060 --> 18:36.800
Wow, you two.

18:36.800 --> 18:39.390
You're really, I don't know,

18:39.390 --> 18:40.240
just like a newlyw—

18:40.240 --> 18:42.880
Chitose-san. Focus on the miso soup.

18:42.880 --> 18:44.270
Yes, ma'am!

18:46.090 --> 18:47.520
Is something wrong?

18:48.130 --> 18:49.660
It's nothing.

18:56.250 --> 18:58.950
Well, I think everything's ready.

18:59.500 --> 19:04.340
Why don't we do the plating, take pictures 
for our report, and start eating?

19:04.340 --> 19:07.870
Yes! About time! 
I'm starting to get really hungry.

19:07.870 --> 19:11.300
That's 'cause you 
skipped breakfast, Ikkun.

19:11.300 --> 19:14.460
Of course I did! I overslept.

19:14.460 --> 19:15.880
Can I have an extra helping?

19:16.210 --> 19:17.920
You most certainly can.

19:17.920 --> 19:23.090
I'll get the salad from the refrigerator, 
so why don't you start the plating?

19:23.500 --> 19:27.700
I'll go with you, too. 
Gotta grab the almond tofu dessert.

19:27.700 --> 19:28.650
Sure.

19:32.190 --> 19:34.340
What the hell? You're burning it!

19:34.340 --> 19:36.940
Shut up! The char is the best part.

19:36.940 --> 19:38.210
You think that's good?

19:38.210 --> 19:41.070
Just watch, I'm only getting started!

19:52.940 --> 19:55.040
Shiina, were you burned?

19:56.310 --> 19:59.050
No, I don't think any got on me.

19:59.970 --> 20:01.300
Did it get on you?

20:01.300 --> 20:05.200
Huh? N-No, I'm all right.

20:05.200 --> 20:06.180
I'm so sorry.

20:06.720 --> 20:10.300
No, you're fine. 
Shiina and I are both okay.

20:10.900 --> 20:14.980
Look, man. I don't care 
if you fool around in a classroom,

20:14.980 --> 20:17.680
but you can't screw around 
when we've got knives and hot pans.

20:17.680 --> 20:19.320
Uh... yeah.

20:19.870 --> 20:22.450
You got lucky this time,

20:22.450 --> 20:25.570
but what if you'd hurt one of the girls?

20:26.150 --> 20:27.900
Would you take responsibility for that?

20:29.430 --> 20:31.280
I-I'm sorry.

20:31.280 --> 20:32.080
It's okay!

20:32.080 --> 20:35.580
Anyway, be careful next time. It's dangerous.

20:41.840 --> 20:43.680
Why do I have to help?

20:43.680 --> 20:44.720
Sorry, man.

20:48.940 --> 20:52.100
Welcome back! Our three-flavor 
bowls are ready to go.

20:52.730 --> 20:54.430
Thank you very much.

20:54.430 --> 20:55.850
I'm exhausted.

20:55.850 --> 20:59.070
You were so cool! And so bold, too.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.110
Unusual for you.

21:00.110 --> 21:02.660
It's not like I wanted to grab her.

21:02.660 --> 21:05.360
I had to, otherwise she'd get burned.

21:07.100 --> 21:09.520
You had to, huh?

21:09.520 --> 21:14.870
I'm still grateful that you did. 
Thank you for pulling me away.

21:23.840 --> 21:29.560
Um, I'm still trying to 
get closer to you at school,

21:30.360 --> 21:32.890
but if it causes problems, 
please let me know, okay?

21:33.220 --> 21:36.030
Well, I think things are okay for now.

21:36.030 --> 21:39.150
I do get a ton of jealous stares, though.

21:39.150 --> 21:40.560
Oh, really?

21:41.470 --> 21:44.890
But I know how lonely it was for you.

21:45.560 --> 21:47.910
I don't want to abandon my friend.

21:49.680 --> 21:50.940
"Friend," huh?

21:51.630 --> 21:53.100
No, never mind.

22:07.940 --> 22:11.260
You can't possibly think that
patting my head gets you out of trouble.

22:11.660 --> 22:14.270
No, I don't. I just thought you'd like it.

22:14.270 --> 22:16.140
I do like it! But...

22:17.770 --> 22:21.980
I hope you don't try 
to distract anyone else like this.

22:22.450 --> 22:24.110
I'd only do it with you, Mahiru.

22:32.820 --> 22:34.530
Amane-kun, you dummy!

22:34.530 --> 22:35.700
What now?

22:37.530 --> 22:40.080
How much work is this going to take?

22:40.480 --> 22:44.000
I have no idea what you mean, Mahiru,

22:44.000 --> 22:47.840
but if you work too hard, you'll get 
burned out, so go easy, okay?

22:50.170 --> 22:52.720
If I don't try harder, it'll never happen!

23:04.410 --> 23:07.400
Just tell me what you want me to do, Mahiru.

23:12.150 --> 23:14.660
You can start by patting my head again.

23:34.890 --> 23:39.890
Next Time
